*   **`solution18.py`** - Exponential arithmetic processing: Calculate the accurate squares of target integers via native exponential tracking operators.
*   **`solution19.py`** - Data structure dimension tracking: Access array sizes using collection length tracking methods.
*   **`solution20.py`** - Binary system status validation: Simulate system clearance access states via direct boolean value validations.

